# Real instance data — NEVER commit a database or a pepper
fixtures/*.db
# A fixture rebuild leaves an empty SQLite journal beside each database it
# wrote. Three commits have dropped them by hand (58d47ecf9, 2e89a3ac3, and
# P4.D169's); this is the line that stops the fourth.
*.db-journal
*.pepper
.env
.env.*

